$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
7-(2,3-O-Isopropylidene-5-O-tert-butyldimethylsilyl-β-D-ribofuranosyl)-4-phenyl-7H-pyrrolo[
2,3-d]pyrimidine (10d). An argon purged mixture of compound 8 (309 mg,
0.7 mmol), phenylboronic acid (128 mg, 1.05 mmol), K2CO3 (193 mg, 1.4
mmol) and Pd(PPh3)4 (41 mg, 0.035 mmol) in toluene (5 mL) was stirred at
100 °C for 5 h. The mixture was diluted with chloroform (20 mL) and
washed with aqueous NH4Cl (sat., 20 mL). The aqueous phase was
re-extracted with chloroform (2×5 mL) and the combined organic extracts
dried over MgSO4, concentrated in vacuo and the residue chromatographed
on silica (hexanes-AcOEt, 10:1→7:1) to afford 10d (320 mg, 95%) as a
colorless oil.
5-Chloro-4-(thiophen-3-yl)-7-(2,3,5-tri-O-benzoyl-β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-
d]pyrimidine (18n). Compound 18n was prepared as described for 10d by
coupling compound 17 and thiophene-3-boronic acid. Yellowish foam. Yield
92%. 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3): 4.70 (dd, 1H, J gem= 12.2, J 5´b,4´= 3.7,
H-5´b); 4.81 (ddd, 1H,J 4´,3´ = 4.5, J 4´,5´ = 3.7, 3.1, H-4´); 4.90 (dd,
1H, J gem= 12.2,J 5´a,4´ = 3.1, H-5´a); 6.13 (dd, 1H, J 3´,2´ = 6.0, J
3´,4´ = 4.5, H-3´); 6.19 (dd, 1H, J 2´,3´ = 6.0, J 2´,1´ = 5.6, H-2´);
6.80 (d, 1H, J 1´,2´ = 5.6, H-1´); 7.37 (m, 2H, H-m-Bz); 7.40 (s, 1H,
H-6); 7.41 (dd, 1H,J 5,4 = 5.0, J 5,2 = 3.0, H-5-thienyl); 7.41 and 7.50
(2 × m, 2 × 2H, H-m-Bz); 7.55, 7.57 and 7.61 (3 × m, 3 × 1H, H-p-Bz);
7.64 (dd, 1H, J 4,5 = 5.0, J 4,2= 1.3, H-4-thienyl); 7.95 (dd, 1H, J 2,5=
3.0,J 2,4 = 1.3, H-2-thienyl); 7.95, 8.01 and 8.14 (3 × m, 3 × 2H,
H-o-Bz); 8.89 (s, 1H, H-2). 13C NMR (151 MHz, CDCl3): 63.59 (CH2- 5´);
71.39 (CH-3´); 73.95 (CH-2´); 80.38 (CH-4´); 86.05 (CH-1´); 106.20 (C-5);
113.79 (C- 4a); 123.88 (CH-6); 125.23 (CH-5-thienyl); 128.40 (C-i-Bz);
128.50 and 128.54 (CH-m-Bz); 128.66 (C-i-Bz); 128.73 (CH-m-Bz); 129.10
(CH-4-thienyl); 129.30 (C-i-Bz); 129.40 (CH-2- thienyl); 129.69, 129.82
and 129.85 (CH-o-Bz); 133.53, 133.74 and 133.76 (CH-p-Bz); 137.71
(C-3-thienyl); 151.04 (C-7a); 151.94 (CH-2); 154.89 (C-4); 165.10, 165.39
and 166.14 (CO). MS FAB, m/z (rel. %): 680 (100)[M+H]. HR MS (FAB): calcd
for C36H27ClN3O7S [M+H] 680.1258, found 680.1247
