$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
4-Amino-5-(3,4-dimethylphenyl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine(1t).
An argon-purged mixture of
4-amino-5-iodo-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (2, 392
mg, 1 mmol), 3,4-dimethylphenylboronic acid (225 mg, 1.5 mmol), Na2CO3
(318 mg, 3 mmol), TPPTS (71 mg, 0.125 mmol), and Pd(OAc)2 (11 mg, 0.05
mmol) in water/MeCN (2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After
cooling, the mixture was neutralized using aqueous HCl (1 M) and
concentrated to dryness in vacuo. The residue was loaded on silica by
co-evaporation from chloroform/MeOH solution, and column chromatography
(SiO2, 0→2.5% MeOH in CHCl3).
4-Amino-5-(phenoxathiin-4-yl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(1ae). Compound 1ae (253 mg, 91%) was prepared as described for 1t from 2
(235 mg, 0.6 mmol) and phenoxathiin-4-boronic acid. White foam. Mp
142-146 °C. [α]D -22.6 (c 0.234, DMSO). 1H NMR (600.1 MHz, DMSO-d 6):
3.56 (ddd, 1H, J gem = 12.0, J 5´b,OH = 6.2, J 5´b,4´ = 3.7, H-5´b); 3.63
(bddd, 1H, J gem = 12.0, J 5´a,OH = 5.0, J 5´a,4´ = 3.7, H-5´a); 3.94
(td, 1H, J 4´,5´ = 3.7, J 4´,3´ = 3.0, H-4´); 4.13 (ddd, 1H, J 3´,2´ =
5.1, J 3´,OH = 4.6, J 3´,4´ = 3.0, H-3´); 4.52 (ddd, 1H, J 2´,OH = 6.6, J
2´,1´ = 6.4, J 2´,3´ = 5.1, H-3´); 5.18 (d, 1H, J OH,3´ = 4.6, OH-3´);
5.24 (dd, 1H, J OH,5´ = 6.2, 5.0, OH-5´); 5.40 (d, 1H, J OH,2´ = 6.6,
OH-2´); 6.10 (bs, 2H, NH2); 6.17 (d, 1H, J 1´,2´ = 6.4, H-1´); 6.795 (dd,
1H, J 6,7 = 8.1, J 6,8 = 1.3, H-6-phenoxathiine); 7.10 (ddd, 1H, J 8,9 =
7.7, J 8,7 = 7.3, J 8,6 = 1.3, H-8-phenoxathiine); 7.18 (ddd, 1H, J 7,6 =
8.1, J 7,8 = 7.3, J 7,9 = 1.6, H-7-phenoxathiine); 7.19 (t, 1H, J 2,1 = J
2,3= 7.5, H-2-phenoxathiine); 7.22 (dd, 1H, J 3,2 = 7.5, J 3,1 = 1.9,
H-3-phenoxathiine); 7.27 (dd, 1H, J 1,2 = 7.5, J 1,3 = 1.9,
H-1-phenoxathiine); 7.28 (dd, 1H, J 9,8 = 7.7, J 9,7 = 1.6,
H-9-phenoxathiine); 7.57 (s, 1H, H-6); 8.16 (s, 1H, H-2). 13C NMR (150.9
MHz, DMSO-d 6): 62.01 (CH2-5´); 71.06 (CH-3´); 74.18 (CH-2´); 85.49
(CH-4´); 87.29 (CH-1´); 101.83 (C-4a); 110.14 (C-5); 118.20
(CH-6-phenoxathiine); 119.80 (C-9a-phenoxathiine); 120.63
(C-10a-phenoxathiine); 122.75 (CH-6); 124.26 (C-1-phenoxathiine); 125.10
(CH-2-phenoxathiine); 125.36 (CH-8-phenoxathiine); 126.33
(CH-1-phenoxathiine); 126.97 (CH-9-phenoxathiine); 128.47
(CH-7-phenoxathiine); 130.33 (CH-3-phenoxathiine); 149.11
(C-4a-phenoxathiine); 150.75 (C-7a); 151.60 (C-5a-phenoxathiine); 151.93
(CH-2); 157.54 (C-4). IR (ATR): ν 1621, 1578, 1541, 1474, 1429, 1301,
1269, 1241, 1217, 1122, 1078, 1032, 987, 872, 782, 753 cm-1. MS (ESI) m/z
465 (M+H), 487 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C23H21N4O5S [M+H] calcd: 465.1227;
found: 465.1226. Anal. (C23H20N4O5S•½CH3OH•0.85H2O): C, H, N. Calcd for
C23H20N4O5S•½CH3OH•0.85H2OH2O: C, 56.93; H, 4.82; N, 11.3. Found: C,
57.06; H, 4.59; N, 11.08.
