$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
tert-Butyl(trans-4-{[3-(2-Aminopyrimidin-5-yl)imidazo[1,2-b]-pyridazin-6-yl]amino}cyclohexyl)carbamate
5. A mixture of 4 (1.20 g, 2.92 mmol, 1.0 equiv),
2-aminopyrimidine-5-boronic acid pinacol ester (970 mg, 4.39 mmol, 1.5
equiv), Cs2CO3 (3.81 g, 11.7 mmol, 4.0 equiv), water (6 mL), and dioxane
(12 mL) was degassed with N2, then Pd(dppf)Cl2 (238 mg, 0.29 mmol, 0.1
equiv) was added, and the mixture heated at 90 °C for 5 h. The mixture
was allowed to cool, then concentrated to dryness and purified by
chromatography on silica gel (2-20% MeOH/EtOAc) to give 5. (b) Following
the procedure for 5 using
3-bromo-N-[2-(pyrrolidin-1-yl)ethyl]imidazo[1,2-b]pyridazin-6-amine, we
obtained
3-(2-aminopyrimidin-5-yl)-N-[2-(pyrrolidin-1-yl)ethyl]imidazo[1,2-b]pyridazin-6-amine
as an off-white solid (91% yield). 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ ppm 8.93
(s, 2H), 7.78-7.72 (m, 2H), 7.15 (br. s, 1H), 6.83 (s, 2H), 6.70 (d, J =
9.6 Hz, 1H), 3.45 (br. s, 2H), 3.09-2.61 (m, 6H), 1.85-1.70 (m, 4H). m/z
(ES + APCI)+: 325 [M + H]+.
